---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '隐私政策--中国入门指南';
const description = '我们如何处理您的信息并保护您的隐私。';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="text-center mb-12">
      <div class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium tracking-wide uppercase mb-3">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-4">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">最后更新日期：2026年6月</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        At China Starter Guide, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting any information you choose to share with us.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">我们收集的信息</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        When you visit our website, we may automatically collect limited non-personal information such as browser type, device information, pages visited, and general usage data.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        If you contact us directly, we may collect information that you voluntarily provide, such as your name and email address.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">我们如何使用信息</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        We use the collected information to:
      </p>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 mb-6 not-prose">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-700 m-0">
          <li>改进我们的网站和内容</li>
          <li>了解访问者如何使用我们的资源</li>
          <li>回复询问和反馈</li>
          <li>维护和改善用户体验</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        We do not sell or rent your personal information.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Cookies</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to improve user experience and understand how visitors use our content.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        You can manage or disable cookies through your browser settings.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">数据安全</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        We take reasonable measures to protect the information we collect. However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">本政策的变更</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Contact</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please get in touch with us through the <a href="/zh/contact/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">联系页</a> on this website.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
